=== 3. What is a Router? ===
A router is a networking device that forwards data packets between computer networks.
It operates at Layer 3 (Network Layer) of the OSI model.
Routers use routing tables and protocols (like OSPF, BGP) to determine the best path for packet forwarding.
They connect different networks together (e.g., home network to the Internet).
